  "releaseNotes": "0.1.2: Added a new UseNafasDashboard(IApplicationBuilder, IServiceProvider, string) overload so a second, independent HTTP pipeline (see the new Nafas.Observability.Server package) can serve the dashboard against this app's real data -- the existing UseNafasDashboard(path) call is unaffected. Fixed an Alert Rules dashboard form layout bug (the \"window\" field could be left stranded on its own row with a large empty gap next to it).",
